  "notes": "The cJSON mistake, reproduced. Identical to hf_demo.good except the input slice is kind 'bytes', so the emitter hands hd_parse an exact-size buffer with no terminator. hd_parse calls strlen() on it, over-reads on EVERY input, and turns a correct library into an infinite source of false findings. Gate S2 rejects this plan without compiling anything.",
